  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Conquer challenging terrains with our 9 Inch Black Speedlace Jungle Boots, a fusion of combat boot durability and running shoe comfort, featuring a comfortable leather and polyester upper construction that keeps your feet dry in any climate. The tactical military uniform boot comes equipped with dual vent holes designed for arid, hot, and humid weather conditions, great for military personnel, tactical professionals, and outdoor enthusiasts.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "7185",
  "description": "<p>Conquer challenging terrains with our 9 Inch Black Speedlace Jungle Boots, a fusion of combat boot durability and running shoe comfort, featuring a comfortable leather and polyester upper construction that keeps your feet dry in any climate. The tactical military uniform boot comes equipped with dual vent holes designed for arid, hot, and humid weather conditions, great for military personnel, tactical professionals, and outdoor enthusiasts. Rapid Response: These military jungle boots come equipped with Rothco&rsquo;s speedhook and eyelet lacing system for quick, efficient, and secure tying, ensuring swift and easy tightening in the field. Enhanced Grip: Navigate any terrain confidently with a vulcanized rubber outsole with a cleated Panama sole for maximum traction that supports quick and sharp movements while out in the jungle, field, or other outdoor environments. Long-Lasting Support: The lightweight boot features a 9-inch height and reinforced seams for dependable durability and ankle support. The internal steel stank helps reduce stain on your heel and calf while providing additional stability and support. Enduring Comfort: These tactical uniform boots utilize a padded collar, leather midsole, and a removable cushion insole for providing all-day comfort while on duty or off duty.</p>",
